  "description": "MVVM toolkit for .NET MAUI featuring ViewModelField for form binding, SelectableCollectionViewModel for lists with selection tracking, MessagingViewModelBase for ViewModel-driven dialogs, and value converters. Reduces boilerplate and simplifies data binding in MAUI apps.",
